    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s not just a chapter though. chapters end and you start a new one. this feels more like the structure itself is just rotting away. like there’s nothing left to save. it’s exhausting to keep trying to light candles in rooms that are just too cold to hold the flame anymore. it feels almost... more peaceful to just let the darkness happen.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
